"other-than-fairly beautiful" would cover any degree of
beauty but "fairly", e.g. "very", "almost", "not at all",
"sorta".

"less-then-fairly beautiful" would cover any degree of beauty
in NEG direction, from "slightly/barely beautiful" to "not at
all beautiful". More-than would be the opposite.

